{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Darkness has won\u2026</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The sun no longer rises\u2026</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The last flickers of light are fading out\u2026</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/bf501a5f24161cda3da9fead208cb99d.avif?t=1773898762\" width=1482 height=445 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>ASCEND</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark upon an epic quest to restore light to the world by climbing through a diverse set of environments in <i>Celestial Lumina</i>, a hand-crafted, 2D Pixel Art Metroidvania. Climb from the roots of the earth to the ruins of a once-great empire, expanding your arsenal of abilities to battle against the Darkness. Each new area brings added movement, tools, and secrets.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.poster.avif?t=1773898762\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.webm?t=1773898762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/454f665c704db8ac24047fa0d95bae68.mp4?t=1773898762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>EVOLVE</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your abilities evolve as you progress, opening new ways of traversing the world and fighting enemies. Additionally, you can use special collectible items to aid you in your exploration and combat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/4f4e136c34975f92ac11b3a477ead9a4.avif?t=1773898762\" width=1560 height=689 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>EXPLORE</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel through a vast world. An ancient kingdom, powerful city, hulking mountains, and strange wildernesses dot the landscape. Along the way, meet a colorful cast of characters. Each new environment introduces new mechanics, allowing you to harness the light within.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/extras/a8724608683e5d1435cd5734976158c0.avif?t=1773898762\" width=1501 height=835 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>FIGHT</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Along the way, foes who seek to destroy the light will hinder your progress. Each fight requires careful timing, light management, and mobility; each victory restores a little light to the shrouded world. Slash through enemies with your heavy blade, or blast enemies from afar using your stargun blaster.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>RISE</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness reigns.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is enshrouded by evil.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only one can restore the light.\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World of Celestial Lumina invites you to embark upon this quest. Bring back the light, or die trying.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Celestial Lumina and join the ascent.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963060?t=1773898762","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963060?t=1773898762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963060/aa7437165bf1134